      "url": "https://neoinsurancesolutions.talentlms.com/plus/my/training/202/units/2299",
      "v": "A mandatory Post-Close Verification Script exists and must be read on a recorded line before the end of every enrollment call. Its confirmations, in order: (1) the agent will review important details and ask the client to confirm understanding after each statement; (2) this is a Group Limited Medical plan offered to working owners of Population Science Management, providing limited benefits for certain covered services, NOT major medical insurance, and it will not cover all healthcare expenses; (3) the client confirms willingness to share personal health and consumer insights data as a Working Owner in Population Science Management; (4) the plan does not provide full maternity coverage; (5) if the client or a dependent needs ongoing treatment, frequent doctor visits, or continuous management of a medical condition, this plan may not meet those needs; (6) only dependents specifically enrolled that day will be covered and anyone not listed will not have benefits; (7) the pre-existing conditions limitation; (8) the client confirms understanding that the plan provides limited medical benefits, is not major medical coverage, and that they enroll with full awareness of the plan's limits and exclusions; closing with 'Thank you. I will now complete your enrollment.'",
